<title>USA: EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</title>
<headline>EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</headline>
<text>
<p>Averages (1,000 bbls/day) for first 270 days of 1996:</p>
<p>---------------------------1996------1995----Pct Chg</p>
<p> Gasoline..................7,828.....7,786......0.5</p>
<p> Distillate Fuel ..........3,337.....3,186......4.7</p>
<p> Residual Fuel...............857.......839......2.1</p>
<p> Jet Fuel..................1,573.....1,493......5.4</p>
<p> Other Oils................4,476.....4,321......3.6</p>
<p> Total Products Supplied..18,071....17,626......2.5</p>
<p> Domestic Crude Output.....6,477.....6,578.....-1.5</p>
<p> Crude Imports (Exc SPR)...7,493.....7,264......3.2</p>
<p> Refinery Crude Runs......14,150....14,022......0.9</p>
</text>
